<title>INDIA: Bomb kills four in India's Punjab state.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills four in India's Punjab state.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDIGARH, India 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least four people were killed in a powerful bomb explosion near a train station in India's northern state of Punjab on Friday, police said.</p>
<p>They said the blast in the city of Jalandhar injured 13 people, three of them seriously.</p>
</text>
